{
  "_comment": "Input of tools/build_catalog.py: MCU families, targets, boards, RTOS backends, bus kinds and kb-core facts that no driver.yml carries. Peripheral counts are the general-purpose instances a port can hand to drivers (from the vendor's SoC capability tables); usable_gpio is an approximate count for the named board and null where it is not known.",
